{title: Faith Comes From Hearing}
{subtitle: Romans 10:17}
{key: Eb}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Eb] | [Eb] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] |
| [Abmaj7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]How can they call on the [Gm7]one unknown
[Cm7]How can they trust a face [Abmaj7]not seen
[Eb]The bridge of belief must [Gm7]be drawn
Before the [Abmaj7]voice is ever [Bb]heard
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Cm]How can they believe with[Gm7]out a sound
[Ab]Without a preacher stan[Eb]ding [Bb/D]near
[Cm]How can they hear [Gm7]if no one speaks
Un[Abmaj7]less the messenger is [Bb]sent
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Eb]So faith comes from hearing clearly [Gm7]now
And [Cm]hearing comes through the word of [Ab]Christ
The [Eb]voice has gone out to the [Gm7]earth
The [Ab]words to the [Bb]ends of the [Eb]world [Gm7][Cm7][Abmaj7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]How beautiful the feet [Gm7]that run
[Cm7]Carrying the good news [Ab]to the gate
[Eb]Not all have obeyed the [Gm7]call
But the [Abmaj7]message rings with ho[Bb]ly weight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Cm]How can they believe without [Gm7]a sound
[Ab]Without a preacher stan[Eb]ding [Bb/D]near
[Cm]How can they hear if no [Gm7]one speaks
Unless [Ab]the messenger is [Bb]sent
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Eb]So faith comes from hearing clearly [Gm7]now
And [Cm]hearing comes through the word of [Ab]Christ
The [Eb]voice has gone out to the [Gm7]earth
The [Ab]words to the [Bb]ends of the [Eb]world
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Ab]I will make you jealous by [Cm7]strangers
[Ab]By a nation without under[Cm7]standing
[Ab]I was found by those not look[Cm7]ing
I revealed [Ab]myself to the [Bb]blind
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
So [Eb]faith comes from hearing clearly [Gm7]now
[Cm7]And hearing comes through the word of [Ab]Christ
The [Eb]voice has gone out to the [Gm7]earth
The words [Ab]to the ends [Bb]of the [Eb]world [Gm7][Cm7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Faith comes from hear[Eb]ing
{end_of_verse}

